{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "満開っ!🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6期生の長嶋凛桜(ながしまりお)です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "読みに来てくれてありがとうございます☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日は2月8日"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "に､､はち､､"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "に､､は､､"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "庭には二羽鶏がいるっ\n庭には二羽鶏がいるっ\n庭には二羽鶏がいるっっ!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "何でもないです\nただ言ってみたかっただけです🐔ｺｹｺｯｺｰ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そういえば最近はアヒルを育てたいな〜なんて思ってます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ﾆﾜﾄﾘｼﾞｬﾅｲﾝｶｲｯ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobkj14ar.png", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mob7ciPO0.png", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日のオンラインミート&グリート\nありがとうございました!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "40枚目期間、とても楽しかったです☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2年目も頑張ります💪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんともお話したけど、\n今朝は雪が積もっていて\n朝からびっくり仰天👀"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "真っ赤な椿に真っ白な雪が積もっていてとても綺麗でした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "花と雪の組み合わせが見られるのは関東ならではかもしれないです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "北海道の場合、\n冬に咲く花なんて中々見ないですから"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobYwzLQl.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "タイトル\n｢虚無ってる長嶋凛桜｣"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "え〜、\nこちらは去年の長嶋凛桜になります。\n早起きをして吹雪の中、学校へ向かっている最中。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どうしてこんなに寒い中、学校へ行かねばならぬのかとトホホ､､､としております"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まつ毛にも眉毛にも雪が積もってるんですよ☃︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この時の寒さに比べたら東京の寒さなんてへっちゃらです︎🌟"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんて言いたいところですが、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "寒いもんは寒いのです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "寒すぎます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ひぇーっ\nさみさみ:( ;´꒳`;):"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さん暖かくして寝ましょうね🌙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ではでは\n今日はこの辺で"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また書くね☺︎"}], "source": "official"}